before:
Complete local C# example; the app does not execute it:
```csharp
using System;
Console.WriteLine(Apply(3, Double));
Console.WriteLine(Apply(3, AddFive));
static int Apply(int value, Func<int, int> operation) => operation(value);
static int Double(int number) => number * 2;
static int AddFive(int number) => number + 5;
```

